note right of "ores::synthetic::repository::yield_curve_process_parameter_definition_repository"
The only read that looks past the latest window. A delete
closes the transaction-time window rather than removing the
row, so read_any_by_parameter_name ignores the window and
takes the newest match, which is how history stays
readable after a delete.
end note

