note top of "ores::synthetic::repository::folder_mapper"
Every mapper exists for the same reason: sqlgen reads and
writes the *_entity struct, while the protocol and the
services speak the domain type. The mapper is the only place
the two meet, so a column rename touches the entity, the
mapper and the migration -- never a service or a handler.
end note

