}
note top of "ores::synthetic::presentation::render_folder_fields"
One free function per entity, named render_<entity>_fields
and living in its own header. Each states its field order in
code, so a field added to the domain type shows up in a
history diff only when the mapper is updated -- the compiler
is the only check, and that is deliberate: reflection would
make the diff order an accident of the type's layout.
end note

