note right of "ores::synthetic::service::catalog_generator_service"
Builds a coherent DQ catalog in memory: accounts, catalogs,
domains, subject areas and datasets reference each other, and
the same seed reproduces the same catalog. It writes nothing.
It also does not call the generators facet below -- it builds
its entities itself, so the two are independent.
