note right of "ores::synthetic::service::organisation_generator_service"
Generates a whole organisation in memory -- parties,
counterparties, portfolios, books, business units, contacts
and identifiers in FK order. Its private helpers read the
country-specific name tables in src/data/ and draw their
randomness from ores.utility's generation_context, so the
same seed reproduces the same organisation.
end note

